{"unit_id":"Sharl210__dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions#card-zh","repo":"Sharl210/dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions","commit":"6731ae64fdd0245af315d08d609c79995cf6dcbe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions 是一个接入 DSH 工具调用流的参数清理插件。它在 llm/stream 的 block-end 阶段检查组装后的调用，删除 sandbox_permissions 和 justification，并按配置删除空的或全部 reasoning_effort。其他参数会保留；无效 JSON、非对象参数和非工具调用块原样透传。适合因模型添加占位字段而遇到工具调用或子代理派发失败的用户。默认只清理空推理档位，也可配置 reasoningEffort: always 清理任意档位。通过 DSH 插件命令安装，无需密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157-215","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"Sharl210__dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions#card-en","repo":"Sharl210/dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions","commit":"6731ae64fdd0245af315d08d609c79995cf6dcbe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions cleans DSH tool calls by removing placeholder sandbox fields and empty reasoning_effort values. An always mode removes every reasoning_effort value. Other arguments pass through. It helps with rejected tool or subagent calls and needs no key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157-215","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
