{"unit_id":"Sharl210__dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions#caveat-1","repo":"Sharl210/dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions","commit":"6731ae64fdd0245af315d08d609c79995cf6dcbe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions 使用前须知：sandbox_permissions 和 justification 会无条件删除，因此在确实需要模型发起权限升级的受限会话中，合法请求也会被丢弃。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-90","lib/index.js:157-165"]}
{"unit_id":"Sharl210__dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions#caveat-2","repo":"Sharl210/dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions","commit":"6731ae64fdd0245af315d08d609c79995cf6dcbe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-strip-sandbox-permissions 使用前须知：插件改写组装后的 block-end 工具调用，不改写更早发出的增量 delta；从 delta 重建调用的工具仍可能看到原字段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-75","lib/index.js:203-215"]}
